      "children": [
        {
          "id": "risk-1",
          "text": "What are the catastrophic and existential risks?",
          "source_url": "https://ai.lifeitself.org/#2-risk-and-pace-given-existential-risk-and-the-chance-alignment-fails-how-should-we-approach-ai-development-and-what-do-wisdom-traditions-suggest",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "risk-1-1",
              "text": "What kinds: loss of control, misuse, irreversible power concentration, gradual disempowerment?",
              "source_url": "https://ai.lifeitself.org/#2-risk-and-pace-given-existential-risk-and-the-chance-alignment-fails-how-should-we-approach-ai-development-and-what-do-wisdom-traditions-suggest",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "id": "risk-1-2",
              "text": "What evidence is there that these are already emerging?",
              "source_url": "https://ai.lifeitself.org/#2-risk-and-pace-given-existential-risk-and-the-chance-alignment-fails-how-should-we-approach-ai-development-and-what-do-wisdom-traditions-suggest",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "id": "risk-1-3",
              "text": "How likely and how soon, and how much do experts disagree?",
