              "children": []
            },
            {
              "id": "risk-3-2",
              "text": "Is it feasible? What mechanisms exist (auditing, compute governance, treaties), and what are the precedents of collective restraint?",
              "source_url": "https://ai.lifeitself.org/#2-risk-and-pace-given-existential-risk-and-the-chance-alignment-fails-how-should-we-approach-ai-development-and-what-do-wisdom-traditions-suggest",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "id": "risk-3-3",
              "text": "Who decides?",
