              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "risk-4",
          "text": "What do wisdom traditions offer here?",
          "source_url": "https://ai.lifeitself.org/#2-risk-and-pace-given-existential-risk-and-the-chance-alignment-fails-how-should-we-approach-ai-development-and-what-do-wisdom-traditions-suggest",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "risk-4-1",
              "text": "What do they say we should do? Is the normative answer clear?",
              "source_url": "https://ai.lifeitself.org/#2-risk-and-pace-given-existential-risk-and-the-chance-alignment-fails-how-should-we-approach-ai-development-and-what-do-wisdom-traditions-suggest",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "id": "risk-4-2",
              "text": "Do they help with how, i.e. solving the collective action problem, and if so through what (e.g. a shift in worldview), or is this where they offer less?",
              "source_url": "https://ai.lifeitself.org/#2-risk-and-pace-given-existential-risk-and-the-chance-alignment-fails-how-should-we-approach-ai-development-and-what-do-wisdom-traditions-suggest",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "id": "risk-4-3",
              "text": "How would a wise process make this choice, beyond weighing a trade-off?",
              "source_url": "https://ai.lifeitself.org/#2-risk-and-pace-given-existential-risk-and-the-chance-alignment-fails-how-should-we-approach-ai-development-and-what-do-wisdom-traditions-suggest",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "risk-5",
          "text": "So: what should each actor (labs, states, communities, individuals) do, and at what pace?",
          "source_url": "https://ai.lifeitself.org/#2-risk-and-pace-given-existential-risk-and-the-chance-alignment-fails-how-should-we-approach-ai-development-and-what-do-wisdom-traditions-suggest",
          "children": []
        }
